    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You lost consciousness in the middle of a riot, dying. You watched yourself took the escalator to the heaven, and failed to qualify. You fell to the boiling hell. When you woke up, you found yourself in a strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the place you want and rest in peace, or regain what you lost and come back from the dead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person horror adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimly lit but visible scene</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative through in-game cell phone messages, text, etc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul>",
